{"id":"9120c20ece14d350","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-ph.md","title":"多项式层次 PH","display":"df-ph — 多项式层次 PH","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-ph","aliases":["29-df-ph"],"display":"df-ph — 多项式层次 PH","depends_on":["[[29-df-ordering]]","[[29-df-atm-accept]]","[[29-df-atm]]","[[29-df-alt-complexity]]","[[29-df-bool-query]]"],"source_locator":"§2.5, Eq.(2.35), pp.40–41, scans55–56; Theorem7.21 p.121 scan136"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-ph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-ph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ph — 多项式层次 PH"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2aab8d6d79a93409\" href=\"?note=2aab8d6d79a93409\" title=\"29-df-atm-accept\">29-df-atm-accept</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"77e57ed488a01e39\" href=\"?note=77e57ed488a01e39\" title=\"29-df-atm\">29-df-atm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8a781a879eb2b5bf\" href=\"?note=8a781a879eb2b5bf\" title=\"29-df-alt-complexity\">29-df-alt-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"92256ad8556a5baf\" href=\"?note=92256ad8556a5baf\" title=\"29-df-bool-query\">29-df-bool-query</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§2.5, Eq.(2.35), pp.40–41, scans55–56; Theorem7.21 p.121 scan136"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为固定有限输入词汇；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_{A,&lt;},n_A,\\operatorname{Decides}_\\tau(M,S),\\operatorname{Time}_M(x)\">\\(x_{A,&lt;},n_A,\\operatorname{Decides}_\\tau(M,S),\\operatorname{Time}_M(x)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8a781a879eb2b5bf\" href=\"?note=8a781a879eb2b5bf\" title=\"29-df-alt-complexity\">29-df-alt-complexity</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Accepts}\">\\(\\operatorname{Accepts}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2aab8d6d79a93409\" href=\"?note=2aab8d6d79a93409\" title=\"29-df-atm-accept\">29-df-atm-accept</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(T,Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall)\\in\\mathrm{ATM}\">\\(M=(T,Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall)\\in\\mathrm{ATM}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_0^M\">\\(q_0^M\\)</span> 为初始状态，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_M(c)\">\\(q_M(c)\\)</span> 为配置状态，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Succ}_M(c)\">\\(\\mathrm{Succ}_M(c)\\)</span> 为一步后继集合，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"77e57ed488a01e39\" href=\"?note=77e57ed488a01e39\" title=\"29-df-atm\">29-df-atm</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Run}_M(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{Run}_M(x)\\)</span> 在下式定义为从初始配置开始的所有非空有限路径；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{kind}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{kind}_M\\)</span> 只在非停机配置上取值。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sup\">\\(\\sup\\)</span> 允许值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\">\\(p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Run}_M(x)\\coloneqq\\{(c_0,\\ldots,c_m)\\mid m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ c_0=\\mathrm{start}_M(x),\\ \\forall i&lt;m\\;c_{i+1}\\in\\mathrm{Succ}_M(c_i)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Run}_M(x)\\coloneqq\\{(c_0,\\ldots,c_m)\\mid m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ c_0=\\mathrm{start}_M(x),\\ \\forall i&lt;m\\;c_{i+1}\\in\\mathrm{Succ}_M(c_i)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{kind}_M(c)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\exists,&amp;q_M(c)\\in Q_\\exists,\\\\\\forall,&amp;q_M(c)\\in Q_\\forall.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{kind}_M(c)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\exists,&amp;q_M(c)\\in Q_\\exists,\\\\\\forall,&amp;q_M(c)\\in Q_\\forall.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alt}_M(x)\\coloneqq\\sup\\left\\{\\operatorname{card}\\{i&lt;m\\mid q_M(c_i),q_M(c_{i+1})\\in Q_\\exists\\cup Q_\\forall,\\ \\operatorname{kind}_M(c_i)\\ne\\operatorname{kind}_M(c_{i+1})\\}\\ \\middle|\\ (c_0,\\ldots,c_m)\\in\\operatorname{Run}_M(x)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Alt}_M(x)\\coloneqq\\sup\\left\\{\\operatorname{card}\\{i&lt;m\\mid q_M(c_i),q_M(c_{i+1})\\in Q_\\exists\\cup Q_\\forall,\\ \\operatorname{kind}_M(c_i)\\ne\\operatorname{kind}_M(c_{i+1})\\}\\ \\middle|\\ (c_0,\\ldots,c_m)\\in\\operatorname{Run}_M(x)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_k^p[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau]\\mid\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{ATM}\\;\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\;(\\operatorname{Decides}_\\tau(M,S)\\land q_0^M\\in Q_\\exists\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\forall&lt;\\in\\operatorname{LinOrd}(|A|)\\;(\\operatorname{Time}_M(x_{A,&lt;})\\leq p(n_A)\\land\\operatorname{Alt}_M(x_{A,&lt;})\\leq k-1))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_k^p[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau]\\mid\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{ATM}\\;\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\;(\\operatorname{Decides}_\\tau(M,S)\\land q_0^M\\in Q_\\exists\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\forall&lt;\\in\\operatorname{LinOrd}(|A|)\\;(\\operatorname{Time}_M(x_{A,&lt;})\\leq p(n_A)\\land\\operatorname{Alt}_M(x_{A,&lt;})\\leq k-1))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_k^p[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau]\\mid\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{ATM}\\;\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\;(\\operatorname{Decides}_\\tau(M,S)\\land q_0^M\\in Q_\\forall\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\forall&lt;\\in\\operatorname{LinOrd}(|A|)\\;(\\operatorname{Time}_M(x_{A,&lt;})\\leq p(n_A)\\land\\operatorname{Alt}_M(x_{A,&lt;})\\leq k-1))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi_k^p[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau]\\mid\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{ATM}\\;\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\;(\\operatorname{Decides}_\\tau(M,S)\\land q_0^M\\in Q_\\forall\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\forall&lt;\\in\\operatorname{LinOrd}(|A|)\\;(\\operatorname{Time}_M(x_{A,&lt;})\\leq p(n_A)\\land\\operatorname{Alt}_M(x_{A,&lt;})\\leq k-1))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PH}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\geq1}(\\Sigma_k^p[\\tau]\\cup\\Pi_k^p[\\tau]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PH}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\geq1}(\\Sigma_k^p[\\tau]\\cup\\Pi_k^p[\\tau]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §2.5，式(2.35)，印刷页40–41、扫描页55–56；Theorem 7.21，印刷页121、扫描页136。第一层从存在状态开始且不切换，故对应NP；第k层至多k−1次切换。终止状态不产生一次额外切换。替换旧的未定义 accepts/Time/Start 调用，资源与判定接口统一采用实际上游。所有合法有限输入的运行路径都参与资源界；不依赖 Remark 才能发现输入编码及停机条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-ordering","status":"resolved","id":"4f651c8d1bdc9a58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ordering]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-atm-accept","status":"resolved","id":"2aab8d6d79a93409","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-atm-accept]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-atm","status":"resolved","id":"77e57ed488a01e39","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-atm]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-alt-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"8a781a879eb2b5bf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-alt-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bool-query","status":"resolved","id":"92256ad8556a5baf","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-bool-query]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-alt-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"8a781a879eb2b5bf","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau$ 为固定有限输入词汇；$x_{A,<},n_A,\\operatorname{Decides}_\\tau(M,S),\\operatorname{Time}_M(x)$ 采用 [[29-df-alt-complexity]]，$\\operatorname{Accepts}$ 采用 [[29-df-atm-accept]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-atm-accept","status":"resolved","id":"2aab8d6d79a93409","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau$ 为固定有限输入词汇；$x_{A,<},n_A,\\operatorname{Decides}_\\tau(M,S),\\operatorname{Time}_M(x)$ 采用 [[29-df-alt-complexity]]，$\\operatorname{Accepts}$ 采用 [[29-df-atm-acc